# Error / 404 pages (must)

**Required on every landing project and every new site from this pack.** Do not ship without a branded 404.

Match the site theme. Never leave the blank Next.js default.

## Required files

| Piece | Path |
|-------|------|
| 404 route | `src/app/not-found.tsx` |
| Copy | `src/data/error.ts` |
| Assets / tokens | `@/config/brand`, CSS vars |

## Visual contract (any brand)

1. Full-bleed brand landscape / mountain (local asset from pack)
2. Soft overlay for readability (layered bg)
3. Frosted content panel (`bg-white/85` + `backdrop-blur` + rounded)
4. Display font for code (`404`) + brand gold/accent on headline
5. Script font line for warmth (`--font-script`)
6. Primary CTA → home (`/`), icon + hover + `cursor-pointer`
7. Optional mini header with Logo link home

## Rules

- Copy: no em/en dashes
- Mobile-first; 320 → 1280+; no horizontal scroll
- Reuse `Button` / brand icons when possible
- Prefer Server Component unless motion needs client
- Same pack works for **any** landing: swap assets/copy via brand + `error.ts`

## Never

- Generic unstyled Next error dump
- Purple / cream-terracotta AI default looks
- Hotlinked remote backgrounds when local assets exist
- Claiming a landing “complete” without `not-found.tsx`
